# Trivy vulnerability exemptions for the service production images.
#
# This mirrors the npm-audit gate's exemption list in scripts/audit-bulk.mjs.
# Both scanners must agree: an advisory that is un-actionable there (no reachable
# patched version) is equally un-actionable in the image scan. Keep the two lists
# in sync — remove an entry here the moment its audit-bulk counterpart is removed.
#
# (No active exemptions.) The former CVE-2026-14257 / GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg
# brace-expansion OOM exemption was dropped in ADS-1053: upstream shipped the
# 1.x/2.x patches (1.1.18 / 2.1.4) the exemption was waiting on, and the
# pnpm.overrides now pin every reachable brace-expansion line to a patched
# release, so the advisory no longer resolves in any image.
